  "required_beats": [
    {
      "id": "95-S2-R1",
      "description": "贾芸带看两三处，按房钱、漏风、能修与日用距离比较；最终偏向漏风但便宜的住处，帮的是寻找接口。",
      "status": "PENDING",
      "scope": "CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT",
      "grounding": {
        "seed": {
          "path": "data/prewrite/v06.json",
          "pointer": "/omitted_scene_plans/14/candidate_scenes/1",
          "ref": "data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/14/candidate_scenes/1",
          "sha256": "caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff",
          "text_sha256": "d0e3b68d8600ff2b676623bc3821e9070d3bf2371ceb698c0c394f057fa56c7f",
          "value": {
            "id": "95-S2",
            "title": "贾芸帮忙找房，不帮他们“解决贫困”"
          }
        },
        "chapter_card_fields": [
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                39070,
                39155
              ],
              "lines": [
                968,
                970
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "19583312c2318dc5fc0b410c9b053c6d7f8b59b697e8c0e68bfed97c4d1d6ed2"
            },
            "name": "最薄处",
            "number": 3,
            "text": "**3｜最薄处**  \n仅需补“为什么从借住院搬到偏院”的住房桥。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                39155,
                39294
              ],
              "lines": [
                971,
                973
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "01c5b312333a9bce40f50b60f913e6419bb08d90ec4869e10707539b43e6a8cc"
            },
            "name": "缺失情节",
            "number": 4,
            "text": "**4｜缺失情节**  \n95-S1借住不能久；S2贾芸带看两三处；S3选漏风但便宜；搬家第一次主动舍弃笨重旧物。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                39294,
                39383
              ],
              "lines": [
                974,
                976
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "3333cad16c51abb5a641bcd1f5d800b4e7ccfb73d645d7a8b855999df44c7d98"
            },
            "name": "人物",
            "number": 5,
            "text": "**5｜人物**  \n贾芸、房东/代管者、当铺伙计、米铺、炭贩、邻妇。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                39798,
                39962
              ],
              "lines": [
                992,
                994
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "45d33bddcca5fba7fb4486f420fcaa98543b7dcc20c2cc17df615dc0b09b3bc3"
            },
            "name": "四链",
            "number": 11,
            "text": "**11｜四链**  \nE3：现金稀缺，房钱/米/炭/药/灯油不能同时满足。宝钗最早知钱，麝月最清楚米，宝玉在物件消失时才感知。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                40344,
                40563
              ],
              "lines": [
                1010,
                1013
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "be05e81b763f4ffb014ae8016242dcd32eb6f2e36c96e930e75f558d6b5bd719"
            },
            "name": "章法 / 风险",
            "number": 18,
            "text": "**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n借院到期 → 看房 → 舍弃/搬 → 典物 → 买米炭 → 一日三餐与针线 → 夜风破毡 → 明日仍“两碗半”。  \n**风险：**把贫困当审美或苦难竞赛。\n\n"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "95-S2-R2",
      "description": "宝钗首先衡现金，麝月知道米够不够，宝玉更从眼前东西消失感到贫困；找房不使房钱米炭药灯油同时够用。",
